; FD-78 guard fixture (prune-dead-storage-image-types): a format-less
; storage image type referenced by NOTHING except an OpConstant whose
; VALUE equals the type's id (%6). The prune's liveness scan
; counted raw words, constant values included, so the type survived
; and its stray capability stayed; the operand-aware scan
; (operandRefIds) does not count a constant's value words.
OpCapability Shader
OpCapability StorageImageWriteWithoutFormat
OpMemoryModel Logical GLSL450
OpEntryPoint Fragment %main "main"
OpExecutionMode %main OriginUpperLeft
%void = OpTypeVoid
%fn = OpTypeFunction %void
%float = OpTypeFloat 32
%uint = OpTypeInt 32 0
%img = OpTypeImage %float 2D 0 0 0 2 Unknown
%c = OpConstant %uint 6
%main = OpFunction %void None %fn
%l = OpLabel
OpReturn
OpFunctionEnd
